{
  "id": "dmw7txpzj1eu2",
  "name": "卡片放大弹窗",
  "tags": [
    "展开",
    "弹窗"
  ],
  "summary": "点击卡片时它从原位放大成居中弹窗，遮罩淡入；关闭时缩回原卡片位置。",
  "usage": "卡片网格里需要看详情、但又不想跳页的场景（作品集、模板库、文件预览）；卡片本身信息密度低。",
  "caution": "卡片数量超过 30 个时先分页/虚拟滚动；弹窗里要放完整内容而不是卡片内容照搬；移动端改成全屏页更稳。",
  "hint": "点卡片放大，点遮罩或关闭还原",
  "prompt": "【卡片放大弹窗】目标：点一张卡片，它从原位「长」成居中大弹窗，标题位置保持连续；弹窗内容 = 卡片信息 + 新增详情，动画结束后详情再淡入。\n\n1) 结构：.grid 里若干 .card（图标 + 标题 + 数量）；.overlay（fixed inset:0）里放 .modal。modal 头部结构与卡片一致。\n\n2) 卡片尺寸：图标 22 + 两行文字（各约 13px 行高）+ 两个 gap + padding 9×2 ≈ 84px；文字设 `line-height:1.3`。高度不足时文字会被垂直裁掉。\n\n3) 打开（FLIP）：读卡片 rect 与 modal rect，算 `sx/sy/tx/ty`，`modal.animate([{transform:translate(tx,ty) scale(sx,sy), opacity:.75},{transform:'none',opacity:1}], 340ms)`。\n\n4) 信息逐渐变多：`.mbody{opacity:0}`，onfinish 后加 `.on` 淡入。\n\n5) **关闭不能闪（两次踩坑）**：\n   - 不要在关闭动画开始前就把详情收起来（内容「啪」少一块）；\n   - **弹窗收缩动画的终点 opacity 必须是 0**，不能停在 .6——否则动画结束、`display:none` 挂上的瞬间会「闪一下」；\n   - 遮罩淡出与弹窗收缩用**相同 duration**（280ms），并在 modal 的 onfinish 里统一收尾（display:none + cancel 动画 + 移除详情态）；\n   - 加一个 `closing` 标志，防止连点关闭重复触发。\n\n6) 高度：modal 不要设固定 min-height；卡片模式隐藏第二行 meta。\n\n7) 无障碍：卡片 tabindex=\"0\" + aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"；modal role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\"。\n\n8) 配色：遮罩 color-mix(in srgb,#000 42%,transparent)；modal var(--ui-surface)。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环；演示开头用 `setTimeout` 等一次关闭动画跑完再开下一轮，不要和关闭动画抢。\n\n10) 使用场景：卡片网格看详情；数量大要先分页；移动端改全屏页。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}\n\n.grid{display:flex;gap:10px}\n.card{width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  cursor:pointer;padding:9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;user-select:none;overflow:hidden;\n  transition:border-color .16s ease,transform .16s ease}\n.card:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-border));transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.card .ico{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;flex:0 0 auto;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 60%,transparent),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,transparent))}\n.card b{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.card small{font-size:9px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n\n.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,#000 42%,transparent)}\n.modal{width:min(400px,88vw);border-radius:16px;background:var(--ui-surface);\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);box-shadow:0 30px 80px color-mix(in srgb,#000 30%,transparent);\n  padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;transform-origin:0 0}\n\n.mhead{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0}\n.mhead .ico{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;flex:0 0 auto;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 60%,transparent),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,transparent))}\n.mhead b{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;min-width:0}\n.mhead small{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);flex:0 0 auto}\n\n.mbody{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .24s ease}\n.mbody.on{opacity:1}\n.mbody p{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.mrows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n.mrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface-2);font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.mrow b{color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600}\n\n.close{align-self:flex-end;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface-2);\n  color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:11px;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .grid{gap:8px}\n  .card{width:74px;height:72px;padding:7px;border-radius:9px;gap:4px}\n  .card .ico{width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:5px}\n  .card b{font-size:9px}\n  .card small{font-size:8px}\n  .modal{width:min(380px,92vw);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;gap:8px}\n  .mhead .ico{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:7px}\n  .mhead b{font-size:13px}\n  .mhead small{font-size:10px}\n  .mbody{gap:7px}\n  .mbody p{font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}\n  .mrows{gap:5px}\n  .mrow{padding:5px 8px;font-size:9.5px}\n  .mrows .mrow:nth-child(2){display:none}\n  .close{font-size:10px;padding:4px 11px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .card,.mbody{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\">\n  <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">\n    <i class=\"ico\"></i><b>设计系统</b><small>12 个组件</small>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">\n    <i class=\"ico\"></i><b>动效规范</b><small>8 条原则</small>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">\n    <i class=\"ico\"></i><b>色彩方案</b><small>3 套主题</small>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"overlay\" id=\"overlay\">\n  <div class=\"modal\" id=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"mhead\">\n      <i class=\"ico\"></i>\n      <b id=\"mTitle\">设计系统</b>\n      <small id=\"mMeta\">12 个组件</small>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mbody\" id=\"mBody\">\n      <p id=\"mDesc\">卡片上的标题和数量原样带过来，下面是展开后才出现的信息——所以看起来是这张卡片长大了、内容变多了，而不是弹出了另一个窗口。</p>\n      <div class=\"mrows\">\n        <div class=\"mrow\"><span>最近更新</span><b id=\"mDate\">3 天前</b></div>\n        <div class=\"mrow\"><span>包含内容</span><b id=\"mItems\">色彩 / 排版 / 间距</b></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"close\" id=\"closeBtn\" type=\"button\">关闭</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var grid = document.getElementById('grid'),\n      overlay = document.getElementById('overlay'),\n      modal = document.getElementById('modal'),\n      mBody = document.getElementById('mBody'),\n      mTitle = document.getElementById('mTitle'),\n      mMeta = document.getElementById('mMeta'),\n      mDesc = document.getElementById('mDesc'),\n      mDate = document.getElementById('mDate'),\n      mItems = document.getElementById('mItems'),\n      closeBtn = document.getElementById('closeBtn');\n\n  var cards = [].slice.call(grid.querySelectorAll('.card'));\n  var DATA = [\n    { desc: '卡片上的标题和数量原样带过来，下面是展开后才出现的信息——所以看起来是这张卡片长大了、内容变多了，而不是弹出了另一个窗口。', date: '3 天前', items: '色彩 / 排版 / 间距' },\n    { desc: '动效规范把时长、缓动、触发方式集中到一处，改一处全站生效。', date: '昨天', items: '时长 / 缓动 / 触发' },\n    { desc: '三套主题共用一套 token，切换主题只换变量不改组件。', date: '1 周前', items: '浅色 / 深色 / 纸质' }\n  ];\n  var lastCard = null;\n  var closing = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function open(card, animate){\n    if(closing) return;\n    lastCard = card;\n    var idx = cards.indexOf(card);\n    var data = DATA[idx] || DATA[0];\n\n    mTitle.textContent = card.querySelector('b').textContent;\n    mMeta.textContent = card.querySelector('small').textContent;\n    mDesc.textContent = data.desc;\n    mDate.textContent = data.date;\n    mItems.textContent = data.items;\n\n    mBody.classList.remove('on');\n\n    overlay.style.display = 'flex';\n    overlay.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n    modal.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n\n    if(animate === false){ mBody.classList.add('on'); return; }\n\n    var c = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var t = modal.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var sx = c.width / t.width, sy = c.height / t.height;\n    var tx = c.left - t.left, ty = c.top - t.top;\n\n    overlay.animate([{opacity:0},{opacity:1}], {duration:200, easing:'ease-out'});\n    var anim = modal.animate([\n      { transform: 'translate(' + tx + 'px,' + ty + 'px) scale(' + sx + ',' + sy + ')', opacity: .75 },\n      { transform: 'none', opacity: 1 }\n    ], { duration: 340, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1)' });\n    anim.onfinish = function(){\n      anim.cancel();\n      setTimeout(function(){ mBody.classList.add('on'); }, 60);\n    };\n  }\n\n  function close(){\n    if(closing || overlay.style.display === 'none') return;\n    closing = true;\n\n    overlay.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n    modal.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n\n    if(!lastCard){\n      overlay.style.display = 'none';\n      closing = false;\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var c = lastCard.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var t = modal.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var sx = c.width / t.width, sy = c.height / t.height;\n    var tx = c.left - t.left, ty = c.top - t.top;\n\n    /* 遮罩与弹窗同一条时间线收缩，弹窗最后完全透明——\n       以前终点只到 opacity .6，display:none 一挂就会「闪一下」 */\n    overlay.animate([{opacity:1},{opacity:0}], {duration:280, easing:'ease-in', fill:'forwards'});\n    var anim = modal.animate([\n      { transform: 'none', opacity: 1 },\n      { transform: 'translate(' + tx + 'px,' + ty + 'px) scale(' + sx + ',' + sy + ')', opacity: 0 }\n    ], { duration: 280, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.4,0,.7,.3)', fill: 'forwards' });\n\n    anim.onfinish = function(){\n      anim.cancel();\n      overlay.style.display = 'none';\n      overlay.getAnimations().forEach(function(a){ a.cancel(); });\n      mBody.classList.remove('on');\n      closing = false;\n    };\n  }\n\n  cards.forEach(function(card){\n    card.addEventListener('click', function(){ open(card); });\n  });\n  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);\n  overlay.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target === overlay) close(); });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape') close(); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    close();\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      var c = ensureCursor();\n      if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n      var card = cards[0];\n      c.el.classList.add('show');\n      c.moveTo(card);\n\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.press();\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.release();\n          open(card);\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            c.moveTo(closeBtn);\n            setTimeout(function(){\n              c.press();\n              setTimeout(function(){\n                c.release();\n                close();\n                if(c.hide) c.hide();\n              }, 190);\n            }, 700);\n          }, 1500);\n        }, 160);\n      }, 560);\n    }, 340);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4600); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
